## Why This Is Asked
Tests practical understanding of memory hierarchy, cache lines, and accurate benchmarking rather than high-level theory.

## Key Concepts
- Memory bandwidth measurement
- Cache-line locality and false sharing risk
- Stride-based access patterns and TLB effects
- Timing accuracy and overhead accounting

## Code Example
